  'title' => 'Document requirements & cost - Dominican vs. Mexixo',
  'postContent' => 'Ok Brides..I need help! For those of you from Canada..
I know I can look this stuff up on the internet but I\'d like some first hand information.
What is the different between the requirement for getting legally married in Dominican & Mexico. Also, what is the cost associated?  How much work is it for each place and how much will it cost?

I\'ve been hearing that Dominican is a lot of work and can cost between $600-$1000 for document translation.

I\'d love some real life examples of what exactly you had to do for documents and the cost for both places! Thank you!!! ',
  'follow' => 'False',
  'sessionId' => '866dc00967461327906b949b49502170',
)
