n the internet but I&#039;d like some first hand information.\n\nWhat is the different between the requirement for getting legally married in Dominican &amp;amp; Mexico. Also, what is the cost associated?  How much work is it for each place and how much will it cost?\n\n\nI&#039;ve been hearing that Dominican is a lot of work and can cost between $600-$1000 for document translation.\n\n\nI&#039;d love some real life examples of what exactly you had to do for documents and the cost for both places! Thank you!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1893367,"PostDate":1429207329,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok Brides..I need help! For those of you from Canada..<br>\nI know I can look this stuff up on the internet but I'd like some first hand information.<br>\nWhat is the different between the requirement for getting legally married in Dominican & Mexico. Also, what is the cost associated?  How much work is it for each place and how much will it cost?<br><br>\nI've been hearing that Dominican is a lot of work and can cost between $600-$1000 for document translation.<br><br>\nI'd love some real life examples of what exactly you had to do for documents and the cost for both places! Thank you!!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shayla.mcmahon@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"70.73.72.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428547145,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Shaylala","Id":282681,"Name":"Shaylala","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8e65fcaec62e929c3314856f427ff30","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think it&#039;s a lot of work in Mexico as well. I know that you have to pay to translate the documents from Spanish to English and blood work is also required. I&#039;m having a symbolic ceremony to make life easier.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893373,"PostDate":1429207925,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think it's a lot of work in Mexico as well. I know that you have to pay to translate the documents from Spanish to English and blood work is also required. I'm having a symbolic ceremony to make life easier.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79073","Title":"Document Requirements & Cost - Dominican Vs. Mexixo","LastPostDate":1429207925},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":3,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}